  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TO35 Disability Inclusive Covid-19 Response in Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The DID programme&#x2019;s COVID-19 response task orders aim to provide a disability inclusive COVID-19 response in a humanitarian setting. To support a disability inclusive humanitarian response to COVID-19 Sightsavers, in its capacity as the fund manager of the DID programme, and DFID have agreed to amend some of the DID programme&#x2019;s standard terms and conditions, as outlined the DID Project Funding Agreement and the DFID NEC3 Professional Services Contract.</narrative>
  </description>
